{
 "dur": 74.8,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.4,
   "chunks": [
    "Your bicep is a lever.",
    "And mechanically,",
    "it's losing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 3.82,
   "chunks": [
    "Take the arm apart",
    "like a machine.",
    "Upper arm: the frame.",
    "Forearm: a beam.",
    "Elbow: the pivot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 10.18,
   "chunks": [
    "The biceps is the actuator.",
    "Its tendon anchors",
    "just 4 cm from the elbow."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 15.73,
   "chunks": [
    "The dumbbell sits",
    "35 cm out.",
    "Pivot, effort, load:",
    "a third-class lever."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 21.44,
   "chunks": [
    "Balance the torques.",
    "10 kg is 98 newtons.",
    "At 35 cm:",
    "34 newton-meters."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 29.08,
   "chunks": [
    "With only 4 cm of leverage,",
    "the biceps must pull",
    "about 860 newtons.",
    "Nearly 9\u00d7 the weight."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 37.14,
   "chunks": [
    "Real arms run",
    "7 to 10 times.",
    "So why build it this badly?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 41.76,
   "chunks": [
    "Speed.",
    "Shorten the muscle 1 cm,",
    "and the hand swings almost 9.",
    "Small actuator,",
    "huge range of motion."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 49.61,
   "chunks": [
    "And the load changes",
    "through the curl.",
    "Arm straight down,",
    "almost no torque."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 54.25,
   "chunks": [
    "At 90 degrees,",
    "the forearm is level.",
    "The lever arm is longest.",
    "That's the sticking point."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 59.89,
   "chunks": [
    "Curl past it,",
    "and the torque drops again."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 63.35,
   "chunks": [
    "So every rep, your biceps pulls",
    "about 9\u00d7 what you're holding."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 67.92,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we take apart next?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 70.03,
   "chunks": [
    "Congrats! You've discovered",
    "the lever in your arm."
   ]
  }
 ]
}